": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5oozmYGZcAQQ7kNvwHjkhmj&_nc_oc=AdrrvO6kF4gqt61WCMQo7Ym7yN2vWik8ZUJYWRVu6xHoB-99AcWdcLpenzeBMTivP4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhsmilydGUQ5oZBzeM737gw5BYa_ggpC3NWFC1zX55eA&oe=6A7478DB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3O4cm2LbVV4Q7kNvwFoX8br&_nc_oc=AdppoJoCGtQq5DiF_PVZDX4wa8zjY8PLAf7XSxIa3FtPJXpMBI65ukkCpQMM7K9Yeyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFUbBvMX3KNtsYFgm0gmMTnBvrNJhqZa1TQBlnjDQxFsA&oe=6A74A161"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aEI0LOpYcpwQ7kNvwF7CVPg&_nc_oc=AdqAr-IcckEcvPJnhVLQ1vJ9245qDOwW8-_V-G7Z9aoIR7HPRDt9LSIF40ZtlszJmUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEekzrYijjUFKnEyMSFKHoQg66uWi73tCjbvOQcHYlJQg&oe=6A748E2F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gi2TQ_Ha-XcQ7kNvwH4Wxaa&_nc_oc=AdookcaHP9RmMBg4CkLQm8qD956x85qLbWnZkaUy4gkB1r9hDWmrwJuYEPTa-B1xYD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQErBbA-K5oVqxHKUCromKLEwlRshcNFWU5T4Hezbx2thQ&oe=6A748DD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wTx1bjI_MSAQ7kNvwHmFZUB&_nc_oc=AdpO7SlctHnCqo4_ua0BS8WBMGu_fowyDqGifLbNmnh8KG1x8ZOo1aKU42AW443-Rpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH8Cn_klY0oqhWCr9YGFGSksQwjq8wsE7TKOqU08TN6TQ&oe=6A74977D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a